<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-15T06:01:58.620Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 06:01:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian forces have entered a key town in Tigray and claimed the regional airport, while advancing toward an Eritrean border town, prompting fears of a wider war. Clashes in Amhara have left at least 183 people dead, according to the UN, and the United Nations has allocated $8.5 million for emergency humanitarian response in northern Ethiopia. Leaders from Egypt, Eritrea, Sudan and Somalia are meeting to coordinate security operations if the conflict spreads across borders. Washington has called for de-escalation as Ethiopia-Eritrea tensions rise. The conflict has caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQb2FQTWlGMzdwSWxvMmdvRDNvc290Qkk2bnpjbkxIaU5UZUVrXzZPbWgzR3JuQ2dPOXkyYlk1VjhMNl8teWJ3aE41UFFLS0pnYlB1ZGEwS0lPYzJYcWRkVjZwdkw3NEgtUXFwZm5jdDd3cXVxdlZCMnEwTDNway1tZmZtMXhjWFl0RmtOTlFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPS2xYb3JZZjd5V0VSaTNTNUlIQ3haLUZjdDhXSllpU3Z6VTg0SkVIUjkwRWJNZ0o2aXZtQTNxSUdHX0VpNUFaMlphS1lkNGZ2X1I0VzVYNUhRMFlhTUVYM3FGQkR5UTkxWmFVREhyZ1dMNTYwQmZmeGhZa3BpQ3FYbWEyTy1HdHNSdEE3UnBWdW45WmFyTm5jYVJjUng?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE5HUGhqbHpRd0poZ1FuY0NQNHVHYlc0S3Y4Rzh5ejJfWDFYbG5Ja1V6TnhFdEg3bUkzRVN6YnkxckVNVmc0UGczVjdWVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxQdVlMSHRXWUJhVldwZ2Q3SWJ1R3d3cVZnRENIQURuZEVPQ1pvbEtQMjY4UW5PYl9MZlJzOHJ2cERtcEQ4d0VXWXFfRzBaa0pHMTZxbW03dFVnam5teV9WVGxILUpadUtJck9hbkU0aElaQUs5eEVRS01wYzNfU0ljVzM3SE5UZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Borkena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOMXc4VVRRNXFTV2phU3lrNlA3R3lFR3d1UTJ0bVNVTzJmVTBfQjNiOXVGMjNJYXR